# Options Guard - protected file list
# One path or glob per line, relative to the game folder (.minecraft).
# These files are read-only while the game is CLOSED (so pack updates can't
# overwrite them) and writable while the game is RUNNING (so you and your mods
# can change settings normally). Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# options.txt and servers.dat are always protected (even against crashes) and
# do not need to be listed here. Nothing else is protected by default - pack
# updates are free to change mod configs.
#
# Glob syntax: * = anything within one folder, ** = anything across folders.
# Examples of extra files you could protect:
#   config/jei/jei-client.toml
#   config/sodium-options.json
#   config/*.toml
